{"version":1,"eventId":"1a530f67-14ae-4bbf-8d8d-fb8c9bfa972d","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"295846f3","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T13:48:50.246Z","entry":{"id":"295846f3","content":"该工作区曾出现 Go 链接器内部 `cmd/internal/goobj` 的 slice bounds panic；后续完整构建失败时，应区分工具链/缓存异常与项目源码或依赖编译错误。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T13:48:50.191Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T13:48:50.191Z","tags":["go","build","troubleshooting"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
