{"version":1,"eventId":"c72c1d01-d37b-4cc4-9f6e-31cb76841d3f","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"6b55889d","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T13:50:16.885Z","entry":{"id":"6b55889d","content":"该环境曾在完整 Go 构建的链接阶段触发 Go 工具链内部 panic（cmd/internal/goobj）；排障时可先执行 go clean -cache，再用 go build -a 重试。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T13:50:16.852Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T13:50:16.852Z","tags":["go","build","troubleshooting"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"cf1b3bd4-de4d-4533-a454-47a49a90a8d7","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"46c56aa8","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T14:31:20.036Z","entry":{"id":"46c56aa8","content":"本项目后端固定使用 PostgreSQL，前端采用 Next.js 静态导出部署；生产环境由 Nginx 托管 `web/out`，并将同域名下的 `/api/` 反向代理到 Go API，前端不运行 Next.js 服务。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T14:31:19.847Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T14:31:19.847Z","tags":["架构","部署","PostgreSQL","Nginx","静态导出"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"c2e3d674-c5f7-4b91-aa3a-b0271d83b1a4","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"82d0c224","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T14:31:21.330Z","entry":{"id":"82d0c224","content":"画布编辑页使用静态查询参数路由 `/canvas?id=项目ID`，不使用运行时动态路由 `/canvas/[id]`；前端 API 请求保持相对 `/api/` 路径，因此后端无需额外增加 CORS 适配。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T14:31:21.218Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T14:31:21.218Z","tags":["Next.js","canvas","路由","API"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
