{"version":1,"eventId":"67312537-aec7-46ac-b5a1-fbe5ab587b75","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"2f9b3bd3","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:12.590Z","entry":{"id":"2f9b3bd3","content":"当前 Go API 认证、设置和提示词路由使用 `/api/auth/*`、`/api/settings`、`/api/prompts`；不要将这些路径误改为 `/api/v1/*`。`/api/v1/*` 仅用于部分 AI、用户配置和画布任务接口。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:07:51.725Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:12.546Z","tags":["backend","api-contract","routing"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
