{"version":1,"eventId":"67cfdcac-d1e3-4625-9eab-e59685336a2a","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"0f4a6278","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:34.114Z","entry":{"id":"0f4a6278","content":"Before any file edit, deletion, or formatting in this project, obtain explicit user permission; do not revert or overwrite existing workspace changes.","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:34.070Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:34.070Z","tags":["workflow","safety","git"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"ea750f90-b729-4f63-9c9e-4fb57ea9facc","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"4abc7988","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:34.425Z","entry":{"id":"4abc7988","content":"The deployment architecture uses a statically exported Next.js frontend served by Nginx under the same domain, with only `/api/` reverse-proxied to the Go service; no Next.js runtime/API proxy is deployed.","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:34.381Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:34.381Z","tags":["architecture","deployment","nginx","nextjs"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"abdc8b06-4499-4917-8f53-c8101d0af7ba","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"0f63c12d","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:34.737Z","entry":{"id":"0f63c12d","content":"Canvas project routes must use the static-export-compatible query form `/canvas?id=<projectId>` rather than dynamic `/canvas/[id]` routes.","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:34.693Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:34.693Z","tags":["frontend","routing","static-export"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"a4141ea1-95a5-4bd2-b687-5d451582a9c7","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"3e3ebf00","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.049Z","entry":{"id":"3e3ebf00","content":"The backend is PostgreSQL-only; SQLite and MySQL are intentionally removed from configuration, drivers, and deployment assumptions.","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.004Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.004Z","tags":["backend","database","postgresql"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"b2bb6261-0c34-4943-978f-11c6d71f1385","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"ae975e71","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.361Z","entry":{"id":"ae975e71","content":"Future AI architecture should use NewAPI as the sole upstream: Infinite Canvas proxies login and all model calls server-side, has no registration endpoint, and disallows local/browser-direct model providers.","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.316Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.316Z","tags":["architecture","ai","newapi","security"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"d1227b98-b4ae-4434-97e3-4f89c8f1c152","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"8a4b7c30","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.672Z","entry":{"id":"8a4b7c30","content":"For NewAPI users, persist the NewAPI user ID and token ID plus an encrypted NewAPI token key on the server; never expose model base URLs or API keys to the browser, and do not store user passwords.","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.628Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.628Z","tags":["newapi","credentials","security","authentication"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"e2cfdf50-1985-452f-85c8-9ee94224bbc6","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"34f45cad","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.984Z","entry":{"id":"34f45cad","content":"The image, video, text, and audio model lists must be returned and validated by the Infinite Canvas backend based on NewAPI permissions; frontend model-name heuristics and user-managed local channels should be removed.","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.940Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:49:35.940Z","tags":["ai","models","backend","frontend"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"2eab96f7-5f70-4dca-8291-32503586acbe","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"ae7f3467","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:24.193Z","entry":{"id":"ae7f3467","content":"本项目采用同域部署：Nginx 托管静态前端，`/api/` 反向代理到 Go 服务；前端不再运行 Next.js 服务端实例。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:11.922Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:24.149Z","tags":["deployment","nginx","static-export"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"9e717377-9aa5-49c7-8971-aa6b22ef5369","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"72f51012","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:24.549Z","entry":{"id":"72f51012","content":"画布详情页使用静态可导出的 `/canvas?id=项目ID` 形式，不使用运行时动态路由 `/canvas/[id]`。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T14:32:03.429Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:24.505Z","tags":["nextjs","canvas","routing"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"b6b01576-d8e7-4f4a-8f59-dec1c28af19f","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:24.916Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"本项目计划将认证和模型请求统一经 Infinite Canvas Go 服务中转到 NewAPI：不提供注册，登录代理到 NewAPI，四类模型列表由服务端返回，禁止浏览器直连本地模型或保存模型 API Key。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:24.872Z","tags":["newapi","authentication","ai-proxy","models"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"1b942182-d7c1-46ef-8bbc-3d6cc922dee5","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:25.250Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"NewAPI 的用户 Token Key 需要可恢复，当前不适合只保存 Token ID；Infinite Canvas 应保存 NewAPI 用户 ID、Token ID，并使用服务端密钥对 Token Key 做应用层加密，密钥不进入数据库或前端。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:25.217Z","tags":["newapi","security","credentials","encryption"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"55520568-0b94-4da1-af96-1526ea5f1327","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"7a18b82b","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:25.551Z","entry":{"id":"7a18b82b","content":"本项目后端数据库统一使用 PostgreSQL，不再兼容 SQLite 或 MySQL。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T13:48:49.556Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:56:25.518Z","tags":["backend","database","postgresql"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"13d3b8ba-846b-4ca1-8327-67756b45401a","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.034Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"本项目的认证计划改为由 Infinite Canvas 服务端中转到 NewAPI，取消本项目注册功能；用户密码不在 Infinite Canvas 保存，由服务端维护自己的会话。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:40.990Z","tags":["authentication","newapi","architecture"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"64431db4-f96d-401f-bfd1-7c3c463bbae8","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.335Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"本项目禁止本地模型和浏览器直连模型服务，所有模型请求、模型列表和用户模型权限都通过 Infinite Canvas Go 服务端处理。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.302Z","tags":["ai","server-proxy","local-models"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"c9e0dd76-0de7-4b23-8ea7-2552114153cd","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"76ef0990","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.647Z","entry":{"id":"76ef0990","content":"NewAPI 用户的 Token Key 按其当前可恢复字段方式由 Infinite Canvas 服务端保存，不做二次加密；Token Key 不得返回前端或写入日志，并需要同步保存 NewAPI Token ID、用户 ID、Token 状态和默认 Token 标记。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.602Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.602Z","tags":["newapi","token","database","security"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"22b7baca-44ae-4cba-a1d1-efed04f56b47","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"a2fc9c1c","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.992Z","entry":{"id":"a2fc9c1c","content":"四类模型列表统一由服务端返回，按 text、image、video、audio 分类，并根据当前 NewAPI 用户的可用模型权限过滤；前端只保存模型选择，不保存 baseUrl 或 apiKey。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.947Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.947Z","tags":["models","permissions","frontend-backend"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"274c31c5-97a9-47be-8289-89adcf728c4b","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"72fcde74","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:42.337Z","entry":{"id":"72fcde74","content":"项目后端使用 Go、Gin、GORM 和 PostgreSQL，数据库通过 GORM AutoMigrate 管理；用户 NewAPI Token 应独立建表，模型定义与用户模型权限分开建模。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:42.292Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:42.292Z","tags":["go","gorm","postgresql","database"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"fead42b1-4a86-4d36-8d6b-efaa5a0cc639","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"ae7f3467","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:08.655Z","entry":{"id":"ae7f3467","content":"项目采用 PostgreSQL 专用后端，前端使用 Next.js 静态导出，由 Nginx 托管静态文件并将 /api/ 反向代理到 Go 服务；动态画布使用 /canvas?id=项目ID。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:11.922Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:08.610Z","tags":["deployment","postgresql","nextjs","nginx"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"9dcd0951-ec69-4df2-a663-f4d0855802a0","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"8127d22f","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:08.989Z","entry":{"id":"8127d22f","content":"项目计划禁止本地模型和浏览器直连模型服务，所有模型请求、模型列表和用户配置统一经过 Go 服务端，模型服务地址与凭据不返回浏览器。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:08.945Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:08.945Z","tags":["ai","security","backend-proxy","no-local-model"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"b82ae351-001d-4289-b2fc-30a4dce763b8","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:09.312Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"认证计划改为 Infinite Canvas 登录请求中转到 NewAPI，不提供本系统注册；服务端保存 NewAPI 用户映射，并负责同步用户可用的文本、图片、视频、音频四类模型。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:09.267Z","tags":["newapi","authentication","models","registration"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"306c74af-4e4f-436d-9a5a-465dcec29d70","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"6d001885","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:09.645Z","entry":{"id":"6d001885","content":"NewAPI 凭据设计需保留用户密码和 Session/Cookie，以支持 Session 失效后的重新登录及手动刷新 token_key；优先复用现有 Session，失效时再重新登录并覆盖旧 Session，避免每次登录产生新的本地 Session 记录。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:09.601Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:09.601Z","tags":["newapi","session","credentials","token-refresh"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"ad7eead6-d3bd-41d5-84b3-0450f64b4d69","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"84585c20","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:09.991Z","entry":{"id":"84585c20","content":"Infinite Canvas 的 NewAPI Token 数据应独立建表，至少包含 new_api_user_id、new_api_token_id、token_key、token_status 和 is_default；token_status 用于阻止禁用 Token 发起模型请求。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:09.946Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:09.946Z","tags":["database","newapi","token","token-status"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"4dd43b56-d0c5-4225-a4af-47fd2d8069d4","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"abc07b5e","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:10.336Z","entry":{"id":"abc07b5e","content":"按用户决定，NewAPI 的 token_key 在 Infinite Canvas 服务端按明文保存，但必须使用 json:\"-\"，禁止返回前端、写入日志或出现在错误信息中；用户密码和 Session 虽需保留，也应与 token_key 分开管理。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:10.291Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:10.291Z","tags":["security","database","newapi","credentials"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"afe79580-e6da-45b9-9243-c10d5a2c5be5","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"ee1411ea","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:10.692Z","entry":{"id":"ee1411ea","content":"NewAPI 当前 Token Key 是可恢复字段而非单向哈希，模型调用依赖完整 Key；仅保存用户 ID 和 Token ID 无法完成后续代理请求，因此服务端需要保存可用的 Key 或可长期复用的认证 Session。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:10.647Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:10.647Z","tags":["newapi","token","architecture","authentication"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"e9a3b2e0-bc3e-43ad-8d07-a2651372d14b","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"43ab5343","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:36.440Z","entry":{"id":"43ab5343","content":"涉及安全凭据时，用户希望保留实现功能所必需的密码和 Token Key，不因安全设计而删除；当前项目决定采用服务端可恢复方式保存，并支持 Token Key 禁用状态和手动刷新。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:36.396Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:36.396Z","tags":["security","credentials","newapi"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"132eb145-76aa-4691-8689-612d5910ba6b","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:36.763Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"Infinite Canvas 的模型调用统一由 Go 服务端通过 NewAPI 中转，禁止浏览器直连 NewAPI、禁止本地模型，文本、图片、视频、音频四类模型列表均由服务端返回。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:36.719Z","tags":["architecture","newapi","ai-models"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"8250c0fd-94fd-449b-817f-4976214fb5dc","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"76ef0990","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:37.097Z","entry":{"id":"76ef0990","content":"Infinite Canvas 登录不提供独立注册，用户登录请求由服务端中转到 NewAPI；服务端应保存必要的 NewAPI 用户映射、密码凭据和 Token 信息，浏览器只持有 Infinite Canvas 自己的登录态。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.602Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:37.053Z","tags":["authentication","newapi","backend"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"6171c54b-3136-47b6-919e-3e2ed237a03d","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:37.453Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"NewAPI 的用户密码在数据库中使用单向哈希保存，无法用于自动重新登录；Infinite Canvas 如需在 NewAPI Session 失效后自动重登，必须将用户原密码以服务端可恢复加密形式保存，而不能只保存哈希。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:37.398Z","tags":["newapi","password","session","security"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"2bfdc6db-e9f1-4444-b496-9d5ada076be8","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:37.799Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"NewAPI Session/Cookie 应在 Infinite Canvas 服务端持久化并优先复用，仅在失效时使用加密保存的密码重新登录，以避免每次请求创建新的 NewAPI Session。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:37.754Z","tags":["newapi","session","cookie"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"dc7ea401-7023-4d54-bf46-5ced5d6a043c","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"625c37b8","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.144Z","entry":{"id":"625c37b8","content":"项目部署采用同域名方案：Nginx 直接托管 Next.js 静态导出文件，/api/ 反向代理到 Go 服务；前端 API 使用相对路径，后端不需要额外 CORS。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.099Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.099Z","tags":["deployment","nginx","nextjs","api"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"d12566ed-ede0-42ad-b367-c33b8ad5a35d","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"7a18b82b","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.489Z","entry":{"id":"7a18b82b","content":"项目使用 PostgreSQL 作为唯一数据库，后端采用 Go、Gin 和 GORM；不保留 SQLite/MySQL 兼容分支。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T13:48:49.556Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.444Z","tags":["backend","database","postgresql"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"c29ba131-7511-4760-90d2-aad025a531ce","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"2a2fa6a5","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.802Z","entry":{"id":"2a2fa6a5","content":"项目采用 Next.js App Router 静态导出，画布项目使用 /canvas?id=项目ID 查询参数，不使用运行时动态路由 /canvas/[id]。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.768Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.768Z","tags":["frontend","nextjs","static-export","canvas"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"dd23dbb7-05ab-41c6-8c4b-2612236500e3","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"4cebf065","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:39.125Z","entry":{"id":"4cebf065","content":"修改代码前必须先读取相关文件并获得用户明确许可；已有工作区修改不得回滚或覆盖，只能在必要范围内追加改动。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:39.080Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:39.080Z","tags":["workflow","git","editing"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"9f96d99a-43da-4974-b9cd-323a26b7bb61","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"eef14f8c","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:39.448Z","entry":{"id":"eef14f8c","content":"用户希望实现保持简单直接，沿用现有 Go/Gin/GORM、Next.js/React/TypeScript 和项目目录边界，避免无关重构与过度抽象。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:39.403Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:39.403Z","tags":["coding-style","architecture","maintainability"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"88a27219-e9c7-4f67-b627-b183c3a850e3","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"de7c315c","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:39.770Z","entry":{"id":"de7c315c","content":"项目约定每次代码修改后不强制执行语法检查、构建或测试，由用户自行验证；但需要关注实际环境中依赖完整性问题可能导致前端构建失败。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:39.726Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:39.726Z","tags":["verification","frontend","dependencies"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"7fa730f9-462c-450f-a303-e05afd8ac5f1","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"76ef0990","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:40.507Z","entry":{"id":"76ef0990","content":"该项目的身份认证统一由 NewAPI 负责：Infinite Canvas 不提供注册，登录请求由服务端中转到 NewAPI，浏览器不直接接触 NewAPI 凭据或模型服务。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.602Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:40.474Z","tags":["authentication","newapi","architecture"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"d9d38255-5c02-48ea-abe7-c5cda9a870c8","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"a1ba7401","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:40.852Z","entry":{"id":"a1ba7401","content":"模型必须通过服务端连接 NewAPI，禁止本地模型、浏览器直连模型、前端自定义 API Key 或 Base URL；文本、图片、视频、音频四类模型列表统一由 Infinite Canvas 服务端返回。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:40.830Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:40.830Z","tags":["ai","newapi","server-proxy","models"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"0172a2c5-0b8c-4ff7-9cae-4cd97aa8bf85","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:41.197Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"为了支持 NewAPI Session 失效后的自动重新登录和 Token 刷新，Infinite Canvas 必须保留用户密码的可恢复加密版本，不能只保存密码哈希或删除密码；同时应复用并持久化 NewAPI Session/Cookie，失效后再重新登录。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:41.175Z","tags":["newapi","session","credentials","security"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"66366496-3227-420e-8635-c082e66cc8c6","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:41.531Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"NewAPI 的完整 token_key 按其现有方式保存，Infinite Canvas 需要同步 token ID、完整 token_key 及 token 是否被禁用；token_key、密码和 Session/Cookie 永不返回前端或写入日志。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:41.498Z","tags":["newapi","token","security","database"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"364b54d8-8ff0-4c32-a135-e5a744720c5e","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"d65e952c","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:41.843Z","entry":{"id":"d65e952c","content":"前后端采用同域部署：Nginx 托管静态前端，只有 `/api/` 反向代理到 Go 服务；前端 API 路径应匹配 Go 服务实际的 `/api/...` 路由，不添加不存在的 `/api/v1` 前缀。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:41.821Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:41.821Z","tags":["deployment","nginx","api","static-export"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"d9d207a6-1185-431e-939f-30851e1d514c","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"ca71cf88","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:42.155Z","entry":{"id":"ca71cf88","content":"画布项目详情使用 `/canvas?id=项目ID` 查询参数，以支持 Next.js 静态导出；不要恢复运行时任意 ID 的 `/canvas/[id]` 动态路由。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:42.133Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:42.133Z","tags":["nextjs","static-export","canvas","routing"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"e0dd7c3c-0a4e-486b-ade7-4363841eb17c","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"625c37b8","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:57.106Z","entry":{"id":"625c37b8","content":"本项目采用同域部署方案：Nginx 托管静态前端，/api/ 反向代理到 Go 服务；前端不再依赖 Next.js 服务端 API 代理。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.099Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:57.062Z","tags":["部署","Next.js","Nginx","API"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"ee18f8e6-45ef-4f41-a74d-387b2ede3d39","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"a1ba7401","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:57.429Z","entry":{"id":"a1ba7401","content":"本项目的模型统一由 Infinite Canvas 服务端通过 NewAPI 中转，禁止浏览器直连本地模型或保存本地 API Key、Base URL 和模型通道配置；四类模型列表由本项目服务端返回。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:07:40.830Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:57.385Z","tags":["NewAPI","AI代理","模型","安全"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"58a0e4b0-0b3c-4ff2-aee2-9221fb2f255f","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"30b62a9c","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:57.752Z","entry":{"id":"30b62a9c","content":"NewAPI 登录接口接收原始明文密码，但 NewAPI 数据库保存的是单向密码哈希，不能还原；本项目若需在 NewAPI Session 失效后自动重登录，必须在服务端以可逆加密方式保存原始密码，不能保存 NewAPI 哈希代替。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:57.708Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:57.708Z","tags":["NewAPI","认证","密码","安全"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"4f5eb643-7425-48c9-9e66-ff1118c2099d","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"6d001885","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:58.086Z","entry":{"id":"6d001885","content":"本项目应在服务端保留并复用 NewAPI 的 Session/Cookie，只有失效时才使用加密保存的密码重新登录，以避免每次请求创建新的 NewAPI Session。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:09.601Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:58.042Z","tags":["NewAPI","Session","Cookie","认证"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"95a5bc1a-84c1-429b-bf27-78c9e84b4415","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"b77839bf","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:58.432Z","entry":{"id":"b77839bf","content":"本项目需要保存 NewAPI 用户 ID、Token ID、完整 token_key 及 token 启用状态；token_key 按当前方案保存为可直接用于模型请求的完整 Key，并且密码、Cookie 和 token_key 均不得返回前端或写入日志。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:58.387Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:58.387Z","tags":["NewAPI","Token","凭据","数据安全"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"532bb2f3-abc1-471f-bd9b-189bb204c552","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"2c7f81f4","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:58.788Z","entry":{"id":"2c7f81f4","content":"项目后端遵循 Go + Gin + GORM 分层：handler 只处理 HTTP，service 负责业务逻辑，repository 负责数据库访问，model 定义数据结构；接口响应保持 { code, data, msg } 结构并优先复用现有查询和分页模式。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:58.744Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:58.744Z","tags":["Go","Gin","GORM","架构"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"565e8753-113f-4275-a19d-470ee7070604","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"61c8c1b4","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:59.133Z","entry":{"id":"61c8c1b4","content":"项目修改必须先读取现有代码并保持最小范围，不覆盖用户已有未提交改动；新增数据库表或字段时同步更新 docs/backend/backend-database.md。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:59.089Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:59.089Z","tags":["开发流程","Git","数据库","文档"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"c6d69a5b-59d6-4dc5-871b-0acc696ebd3c","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"625c37b8","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:10:28.923Z","entry":{"id":"625c37b8","content":"本项目采用同域部署：Nginx 托管静态前端，/api/ 反向代理到 Go 服务；前端使用相对路径请求 API，后端不依赖 Next.js API 代理。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:06:38.099Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:10:28.879Z","tags":["deployment","nginx","static-frontend","api"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
