{"version":1,"eventId":"71a18a05-4bd0-4425-a02c-9d0bb7f3a4dc","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"76ef0990","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:09.922Z","entry":{"id":"76ef0990","content":"Infinite Canvas 采用 NewAPI 作为唯一身份认证和模型服务来源：无本地注册、无本地模型、浏览器不直连模型服务，四类模型列表统一由 Infinite Canvas 服务端返回。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.602Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:09.867Z","tags":["architecture","newapi","models"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"9e636762-5ea8-4351-a5bb-fabb96169764","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"cad2c614","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:10.234Z","entry":{"id":"cad2c614","content":"Infinite Canvas 数据库设计拆分为 users、user_newapi_credentials、user_newapi_tokens、ai_models 和 user_ai_models；用户基础信息与 NewAPI 凭据、Token、模型权限分离管理。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:10.190Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:10.190Z","tags":["database","schema","newapi"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"24d10c4d-ff32-4991-ab88-a49373884a52","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"76ef0990","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:10.557Z","entry":{"id":"76ef0990","content":"NewAPI 用户密码在数据库中保存为单向哈希，无法用于自动重新登录；Infinite Canvas 因此需要保留用户密码的服务端可逆加密副本，并保留密码字段以支持 Session 失效后的重新认证。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.602Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:10.501Z","tags":["security","password","authentication"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"10e3d521-8f8c-4f3f-961f-d4922a25550f","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"76ef0990","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:10.869Z","entry":{"id":"76ef0990","content":"NewAPI Session/Cookie 应在 Infinite Canvas 服务端按用户保存并优先复用，失效后使用加密密码重新登录并覆盖旧 Session；密码失效时设置 reauth_required，要求用户重新输入密码。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:59:41.602Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:10.824Z","tags":["session","authentication","newapi"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"77c77367-6737-4adf-afad-06b66ab75f3c","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"ee1411ea","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:11.191Z","entry":{"id":"ee1411ea","content":"user_newapi_tokens 保存 NewAPI Token ID、完整 token_key、启用状态和默认 Token 标记；请求前检查 Token 是否启用，token_key、密码和 Session 永不返回浏览器或写入日志。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:04:10.647Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:11.136Z","tags":["tokens","security","newapi"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"5eecd1af-9c3f-4d2f-99fa-c3fad6b1ad66","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"2c7f81f4","occurredAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:11.526Z","entry":{"id":"2c7f81f4","content":"项目后端使用 Go、Gin、GORM 和 PostgreSQL；接口遵循 { code, data, msg } 响应结构，并按 handler、service、repository、model 分层。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:58.744Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T18:12:11.470Z","tags":["backend","go","postgresql"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
