{"version":1,"eventId":"2635ee1b-1859-4c9f-835c-9e4f80af7f50","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"24ed5f55","occurredAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:31.102Z","entry":{"id":"24ed5f55","content":"本项目计划将 NewAPI 作为唯一身份认证和模型服务来源：浏览器只持有 Infinite Canvas 登录态，NewAPI 密码、Session/Cookie、Token Key 均由服务端加密保存和处理，前端不得直连 NewAPI 或其他 OpenAI 兼容接口。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T17:40:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:31.068Z","tags":["newapi","authentication","ai-proxy","security"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"ac528422-6e56-46db-a2bb-a6ebe542b4fd","operation":"update","level":"project","memoryId":"30b62a9c","occurredAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:31.646Z","entry":{"id":"30b62a9c","content":"NewAPI 集成需要保留每个用户的一份可恢复凭据和 Session：优先复用 Session，失效后使用服务端加密密码自动重新登录并仅重试当前请求一次；密码失效时标记 reauth_required。","createdAt":"2026-08-27T18:09:57.708Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:31.624Z","tags":["newapi","session","credentials","reauthentication"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"7e8fdd5e-3fe2-462f-b85b-3f9bf2c3e36c","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"003f383d","occurredAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:31.991Z","entry":{"id":"003f383d","content":"模型目录由 Infinite Canvas 服务端维护 ai_models 和用户模型权限，统一向前端返回 text、image、video、audio 四类模型；模型请求前必须校验用户、Token 状态、全局模型状态和用户权限。","createdAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:31.969Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:31.969Z","tags":["models","permissions","ai-proxy","backend"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
{"version":1,"eventId":"126e9701-f56c-48d6-8883-078a040f5ba4","operation":"create","level":"project","memoryId":"d8b53a96","occurredAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:32.281Z","entry":{"id":"d8b53a96","content":"该项目的后端改造应遵循 handler 只处理 HTTP、service 负责业务流程、repository 负责 GORM 数据访问、NewAPI Client 集中处理外部 HTTP 调用的分层边界。","createdAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:32.258Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-28T01:51:32.258Z","tags":["go","gin","gorm","architecture"],"source":"turn-reflection"}}
